                            <span class="truncate">Sai tập / Bị đảo / Thiếu tập phim</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="report-issue-option px-3 py-2 text-xs text-gray-200 hover:bg-[#fcd576]/15 hover:text-[#fcd576] cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors" data-value="Lỗi âm thanh / Mất tiếng / Lệch tiếng" onclick="selectReportIssue(this)">
                            <span>🔇</span>
                            <span class="truncate">Mất tiếng / Lệch âm thanh</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="report-issue-option px-3 py-2 text-xs text-gray-200 hover:bg-[#fcd576]/15 hover:text-[#fcd576] cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors" data-value="Lỗi phụ đề Vietsub / Phụ đề không khớp" onclick="selectReportIssue(this)">
                            <span>📝</span>
                            <span class="truncate">Lỗi phụ đề / Lệch Vietsub</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="report-issue-option px-3 py-2 text-xs text-gray-200 hover:bg-[#fcd576]/15 hover:text-[#fcd576] cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors" data-value="Video bị giật lag / Tải chậm liên tục" onclick="selectReportIssue(this)">
                            <span>🐌</span>
                            <span class="truncate">Giật lag / Tải phim chậm</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="report-issue-option px-3 py-2 text-xs text-gray-200 hover:bg-[#fcd576]/15 hover:text-[#fcd576] cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors" data-value="Vấn đề khác" onclick="selectReportIssue(this)">
                            <span>💡</span>
                            <span class="truncate">Vấn đề khác</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-1 report-modal-label">Mô tả thêm (nếu có)</label>
                    <textarea id="reportIssueDesc" rows="2.5" placeholder="Chi tiết thời điểm bị lỗi hoặc mô tả chi tiết..." class="w-full bg-[#1e2230] border border-white/15 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs text-white outline-none focus:border-[#fcd576] resize-none"></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-end gap-2">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeReportModal()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-gray-300 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors report-btn-cancel">Hủy</button>
                    <button type="submit" id="btnSubmitReport" class="px-5 py-2 bg-[#ff9900] hover:bg-[#ffaa22] text-black text-xs font-extrabold rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer">
                        <span class="material-icons-round text-base">send</span>
                        <span>Gửi Báo Lỗi</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>

            <div id="reportSuccessState" class="hidden text-center py-4 space-y-2">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/40 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 mx-auto">
                    <span class="material-icons-round text-2xl">check</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm" id="reportSuccessTitle">Gửi Báo Lỗi Thành Công!</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs" id="reportSuccessDesc">Cảm ơn bạn. Đội ngũ Kỹ thuật A Phim Super sẽ kiểm tra và khắc phục sự cố ngay.</p>
                <button type="button" onclick="closeReportModal()" class="mt-3 px-4 py-1.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg report-btn-close">Đóng</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>

</html>
